/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (         The Qingliu Tribe is also a famous art village with many colorful murals and three-dimensional sculptures that show the unique aesthetic style of the Sedek tribe. The entire village is an important venue for Sedgwick culture and art, with exhibitions and cultural events held from time to time. At the same time, the local indigenous people have also combined their skills in traditional weaving and wood carving to offer several ethnic-specific experiential courses and activities, allowing visitors to get closer to the daily lives of the local people and gain a deeper understanding of the Sedek culture.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K []
